  /Subject (Supervisory Primacy as the architectural design principle by which human authority over consequential AI decisions becomes a constitutional property of an adaptive AI orchestration system rather than a runtime configuration. Consistent with EU AI Act Article 14, Parasuraman-Sheridan-Wickens supervisory control, and NIST AI RMF 1.0 Appendix C.) /Title (Supervisory Primacy: Human-in-the-Loop AI Orchestration for High-Consequence Domains) /Trapped /False
>>
